  "description": {
    "text": "The reward pack (奖赏包) is the one-card prize in the Happy Set Trainer's Pokémon of 16 October 2026, shared out by the results of the games. It holds one of 14 holos: one of the eight basic Energy, in 87.5% of packs, or one of six Pokémon ex, in 12.5%: Lapras ex, Pikachu ex, Alcremie ex, Koraidon ex, Paldean Clodsire ex and Eevee ex. The six Pokémon ex are numbered out of 6; the basic Energy print their type code.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The new Happy Set: Trainer's Pokémon (21 September 2026)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/23939.html"
      }
    ]
  },
